text I search the depths of my memories.
text One day, long ago...
text Or maybe in the distant future, I'm not sure...
text I was in a different world.
text I remember the feeling of being there, but nothing else.
text Thinking about it warms the very bottom of my heart.
text ..."What kind of place was it?"
text I shake my head.
text ..."Was it better than here?"
text Probably.
text ..."Did you like it there?"
text I think.
text ..."Was it... less lonely than this place?"
text ......
text The girl has always been alone.
text I've found out that this place really does have nothing; that it's a lonely place, devoid of fun...
text And that's why I was born here.
text ..."That's right."
text ..."This is a lonely world, isn't it?"
text ..."Hey..."
text ..."Did you... want to be born in this world?"
text I'm unable to tell her my answer... I simply take her hand.
text That... is my answer, I suppose.
